"Hi! we're an up-and-coming fighting team for matches in The Arena. If you're willing to represent our team, we'll give you various supplies and equipment to help you improve your stats quickly. Sounds good?"

{![tick.png]Yes|trainingGroundsTeamIntro1}

{![cross.png]Maybe Later|trainingGrounds}

You follow the young man in to a large tent on the field.

"This is the tent with all our special training equipment and staff. Training here would be double as effective than the public equipment."

{Next|trainingGroundsTeamIntro3}

As you walk into the dojo, an old man greets you.

"Welcome to the dojo. This is the main place in town where fighters of all classes come to train their fighting skills."

{Next|dojo}

You are in the dojo.

{![chat.png]Dojo Instructor|dojoInstructor}
{![sword.png]Practice fighting a training dummy|dojo_trainingDummy}

As you defeat your first training dummy, the instructor walks towards you.

"You're not from around here are you? You seem like you're from another world but I can see potential."

{Next|dojoQuestIntro2}

You are in the yard of the dojo.

{![training_dummy.png]Golems|dojoGolems}

{![leave.png]Return|dojo}

"Ah, Els sent you right? Here, take this."

You pick up the heavy box the merchant hands you.

