{![enter.png]Town Gates|townGatesNorthExterior|500|endFight}

You slowly walk into the Hunters' guild, the occupants appear to be having a discussion about enemies in the forest. You stand around for a minute until one of them invites you to listen.

You couldn't understand anything.

{Next|huntersGuildIntro}

You are sitting on a chair near the fireplace in the Hunters' guild.

{![chat.png]Talk to Els|huntersGuildEls}

{![leave.png]Leave|huntersGuild}

"The Hunters' guild was founded years ago by a small group of people who wished to research the forest. I was appointed as the leader a short while after the guild was founded."

"The forest is quite vast making exploration difficult. We still aren't aware of all the creatures in the forest."

{![leave.png]Return|huntersGuildEls}

"Quests?"

"I could probably give you a few quests to collect resources, obviously you'll be paid for them. Talk to me again if you're interested."

{![leave.png]Return|huntersGuildEls}

You can see the entrance of the forest in the distance.

{![alley.png]Mine|forestMineEntrance}
{![dumbbells.png]Forest Gym|forestGym}

{![arrow_left.png]Walk towards the exit|forestLayer1|300(Forest Entrance)}

